<title>USA: Wis. $57.1 mln deal repriced, 1997 cut to 3.80 pct.</title>
<headline>Wis. $57.1 mln deal repriced, 1997 cut to 3.80 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
